            <code>vx migrate</code> converts your <code class="turbo">turbo.json</code> or{' '}
            <code class="nx">Nx project graph</code> into a real <code>vx.config.ts</code>. The
            mapping is mechanical — keep your task graph and your speed, drop the daemon and the
            plugins.
          </p>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="cmd-pill"><span class="dollar">$</span> vx migrate</div>
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href={href('migrate/from-turborepo/')}
